# HermesProjects layout

`D:\Programming\AI_Agents\HermesProjects\` holds **Agent Workspaces** only (one folder per chat agent).

## Do

- Put product/app code under: `HermesProjects/<AgentWorkspace>/Projects/<ProductName>/`
- Create `Projects/` inside the workspace that owns the work

## Don't

- Create product apps as siblings under `HermesProjects\<ProductName>`
- Treat HermesProjects root as a general projects dump

## ProjectManager

- Registers initiatives in PM Dashboard; does not implement by default
- Relocates misplaced products **only** when the user explicitly asks (see `HermesProjects/ProjectManager/hermes/prompts/migrate-projects-layout.md`)
- Do not move `KindleConverter` unless the user requests it in ProjectManager chat
